Banyan field record
===================

The dispatch board, member visits, checklists, and per-home equipment history
in this directory are adapted from OpenFieldService:

  https://github.com/clawnify/OpenFieldService

Copyright (c) 2026 Clawnify

Licensed under the MIT License. The license text is in LICENSE in this
directory. That license covers this field app, including the calendar-day
helpers adapted from OpenFieldService src/client/calendar.ts and the visit,
checklist, and equipment record modeled on its jobs, job checklists, and
assets.

The public Banyan marketing site at the repository root is a separate package
and is not part of that upstream project.

This directory is a port onto Banyan's Next.js app, not a vendored copy of the
upstream Preact, Hono, and Cloudflare D1 application. See README.md.
